[legend]
● = bold red3
┃ = grey62
║ = bold gold1
default = indianred

[captions]
Visitors line up to stand with a foot on each side of the meridian line.
The red time ball on top of the observatory drops at one o'clock every day.
The whole of London spreads out below the hill.
